# The samples: the physics with the Heaps layer on, which is the way
# round anyone using this as a library will have it.
#
# -lib heaps is how it should be, and how it will be once this is on
# haxelib. Until then point at a checkout:
#
#   haxe samples/samples.hxml -cp <path to heaps>

-cp src
-cp samples
-lib heaps
-lib hlsdl
-main Main
-hl build/samples.hl
